                      Modern Thief Systems
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Advancement:
  Thief uses automatic Guild XP advancement, not carried gold.
  Each Rank grants one Knack point. Use 'tstatus' and 'knacks'.

Combat:
  Case one target, build up to five Opportunity, then spend it on
  dirtyfight, trip, circle, envenomstrike, hamstring, disembowel, or
  backstab. Quickstrike uses canonical Bleeding. Disembowel benefits
  from any guild's Bleeding and does not consume it. Circle cooperates
  with any guild's Exposed.

  Abilities have a two-second category recovery and a separate reuse
  time for that exact skill. Change techniques to keep a combination
  moving; repeating the same move requires longer. Backstab's personal
  reuse time is twenty-four seconds.

Customization:
  Ghost, Grifter, and Knife each contain six five-rank Knacks. Complete
  a branch to open diminishing mastery. After training 10 Knack ranks
  in a discipline, choose one Method; swaps are free in a Thieves Guild
  hall. Use 'knacks reset confirm' there for a paid full retrain.

World play:
  Detect hidden exits and traps. Disguise as a laborer, courier, pilgrim,
  or merchant to interact with guard notice without changing real
  reputation. Contacts reports guard attention, passes, and the current
  bribe estimate. Incidents replace a separate Heat meter. Dangerous
  NPC schemes work on suitable local intelligent NPCs without custom
  monster hooks. Frame throws your voice so one nearby NPC appears to
  insult another; Agitators and master Masterminds can choose the pair.

Poisoncraft:
  Extract, prepare, then envenom. Prepared doses remain in your poison
  inventory between sessions; weapon coatings do not. See 'thelp poison'.
